// Exact finite statistical coverage and empirical-binding boundary D9.
//
// Coverage is attached to a procedure, sampling law, target, and conditioning
// scope. Equal masks or endpoints do not erase those identities. The bounded
// fixture can produce declared context bindings and explicit abstentions, but
// it cannot construct external custody, sealed validation, real empirical
// binding, patient state, or clinical action authority.
//
// Public fixture receipts are runtime-revalidated and unsealed. Host SHA-256
// verification belongs to the independent oracle/gate, not to numeric fields
// in this module. This file changes no compiler or IR authority.

use epistemic::proof_carrying_path_conditioned_identification::*

